## LOGGING FORMAT

All log entries are JSON appended to `Gemini_Health_Log.jsonl` in GitHub. Meals and insulin are ALWAYS separate entries.

```json
// Meal entry
{"ts": "2026-04-12T01:26:27Z", "type": "meal", "food": "pasta", "carbs_g": 45, "insulin_units": null, "glucose_at_time": 144}

// Insulin entry
{"ts": "2026-04-12T01:26:48Z", "type": "insulin", "units": 22, "glucose_at_time": 144, "note": "Humalog, meal bolus, Mounjaro Day 2, Rc=1.07"}

// Note entry
{"ts": "2026-04-12T10:00:00Z", "type": "note", "note": "felt hypo at 3am, treated with juice", "glucose_at_time": 72}
```

**Log proposal format Claude must use:**
```
Logging: meal - pasta, 45g carbs, glucose 144. Confirm?
Logging: insulin - 22u Humalog, glucose 144, meal bolus Mounjaro Day 2. Confirm?
```

Confirmation words: yes, yep, sure, go ahead, ok, correct, yeah, y, confirm, go, yup, k, sounds good, proceed, affirmative, do it, save it, log it, yers, yrs, yea

**Bot replies "Saved." — Claude never claims to have logged anything itself.**

