## NIGHTSCOUT INTEGRATION

```
Base URL: https://billwells.ns.10be.de
Endpoints used:
  /api/v1/entries.json?count=1           ← latest reading
  /api/v1/entries.json?count=200&find[date][$gte]={since_ms}  ← 2h history
```

No Nightscout API key required (public instance). Readings are `sgv` field (mg/dL). Trend directions mapped to human-readable arrows (↑↑, ↑, ↗, →, ↘, ↓, ↓↓).

The bot summarizes CGM history into a compact string before sending to Claude (max 24 sampled points) to control token usage.

