## CONVERSATION MANAGEMENT

- Rolling window: **last 4 exchanges** (user + assistant pairs) sent to Claude
- System prompt rebuilt fresh on every message (fetches GitHub files each time)
- No persistent session — if the process restarts, conversation history resets
- `/reset` — clears conversation history, keeps parameters
- `/reload` — rebuilds system prompt from GitHub, clears conversation
- `/cancel` — cancels any pending log entry

**MAX_HISTORY_EXCHANGES = 4** (reduced from 6 to control payload size)
**MAX_GLUCOSE_HISTORY = 24** (one reading per 5 min ≈ 2 hours of samples)

