## KNOWN ISSUES AND DESIGN DECISIONS

| Issue | Decision |
|---|---|
| Claude made UTC arithmetic errors in IOB calculation | Moved IOB to Python, injected as pre-computed block |
| Claude sometimes applied Rc to full dose | Explicit rule in Behavior Rules + marked CRITICAL |
| High glucose (delta 133) produced 92-unit dose recommendation | Added HSF_max=0.30 cap in v1.5 — Bill (a physician) caught it; the cap prevents the formula from producing absurd outputs that erode trust |
| Context payload too large | Reduced history to 4 exchanges, CGM to 24 samples, summarized glucose history |
| API 529 errors under load | Retry logic with exponential backoff added |
| Telegram Markdown rendering failures | Fallback to plain text implemented |
| Claude claimed to save logs it hadn't written | Bot owns all write confirmations; Claude only proposes |

